    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "I wish I knew exactly what it was going to look like, but I figure sometime this summer I need to have a little more clarity of what I'm going to do next, but I hope it's something meaningful. But yeah, a lot of possibilities. I'll just say that.",
