    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91655.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "Okay, let's talk about you guys have prepared quite a bit of information for us as you do your farewell tour part of it today. I'm sure we'll see you along the way. Let's talk about agriculture and obviously you have a prominent role in agriculture in the house. Tell us about yesterday's decision-making process involving the meat industry.",
