    "turn_idx": 28,
    "turn_text": "So this is my last year in office. I'm going to keep my foot on the gas and make sure that we're executing on legislation that we've started. I want to make sure that as I look back at my own decade career in Congress or those who I've been fortunate enough to represent, I hope they can say that they felt that I listened to them and did a good job. I'm very proud of an award that we just got not too long ago. You know, awards can be a dime a dozen, right? I mean, there's some that maybe don't mean that much. This one meant a lot. We have explained what it is. We have 222 Democrats. in the U.S. House of Representatives. We have 50 Democrats in the Senate, so that's 272 Democratic offices, and we were rated the number one office out of all 272 of those in our constituent services. And I'm very, very proud of that. You just mentioned Lucy, who's my district director who's with me here today. And it really is a reflection of the great staff, the caseworkers that we have, the people who handle outreach into the community. But I'm very, very proud of that. Because if you look at the job of a member of Congress, when it's all said and done, it's making sure that you're doing right by the people that you represent. In our case, our 14 counties, our 7,000 square miles, 150 towns, we have 711,000 people. It's making sure that we're doing right by people at home. I always say whenever I go into a group of people from our congressional district, I like to say, you're my boss. You know, my boss is not the president. My boss is not the speaker of the house. My boss is the people here. And so I was very, very proud of that. And I want to make sure that we continue strong. And if people come to our office, whether it's for a veterans issue, whether it's Medicare, whether it's an IRS issue, whatever it is that we are listening and we're doing our best to take care of issues that are out there. The federal government can be a huge red tape bureaucracy and our job is to cut through all that and help solve problems and deliver results.",
